---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — Zero Data Access | DontMailMe';
const description =
  "DontMailMe's privacy policy: no cookies, no tracking, no analytics. Our unsubscribe scripts run inside your own cloud, so we never receive your emails, credentials or data. Zero-data by design.";

const breadcrumb = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://dontmailme.org/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Privacy', item: 'https://dontmailme.org/privacy' },
  ],
};
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/privacy">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumb)} />
  </Fragment>

  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Privacy</nav>

  <article class="page">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Zero data access. We mean it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack">
      <section class="info">
        <h2>1. Responsible Person &amp; Contact</h2>
        <p>The responsible controller for data processing on this website according to Art. 4 No. 7 GDPR is:<br />
          <strong>Sedat Gergin</strong><br />
          Please refer to our <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a> for full address details.<br />
          Email: hi@dontmailme.org</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>2. No Cookies, No Tracking, No Analytics</h2>
        <p>We believe in absolute data minimization. This website does not set any cookies on your device. We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixels, or any other tracking tools to monitor your behavior.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>3. Hosting &amp; Infrastructure (Cloudflare)</h2>
        <p>We host our website securely with Cloudflare (Cloudflare Inc., 101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA). Cloudflare acts as our data processor to provide Content Delivery Network (CDN) and DNS services. When you visit our site, Cloudflare temporarily processes technical connection data (such as your IP address) in server log files to protect against DDoS attacks and ensure stability.</p>
        <p>The legal basis for this is our legitimate interest (Art. 6 Para. 1 lit. f GDPR) in providing a secure and functional website.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>4. Fonts</h2>
        <p>This site uses the fonts already installed on your device (system fonts). No web fonts are downloaded, so no request is made to Google Fonts or any other font provider, and your IP address is never transmitted for font rendering.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>5. Script Security (Zero Data Access)</h2>
        <p>The DontMailMe automation tools (Google Apps Script, PowerShell, AppleScript) execute entirely locally on your machine or within your personal cloud environment. We never receive, process, or store your emails, login credentials, OAuth tokens, or any other personal inbox data.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>6. Donations (Stripe)</h2>
        <p>Donating is entirely optional and the tool is free without it. If you choose to donate, the “Chip in” button sends you to a payment page hosted by Stripe (Stripe Payments Europe, Ltd., 1 Grand Canal Street Lower, Dublin, Ireland). The entire payment happens on Stripe's own site: we never see, collect, or store your card details, and we receive no payment data beyond what we need to know that a donation arrived. Stripe processes your data under its own <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>. Legal basis: Art. 6 (1) (b) GDPR (performance of a contract).</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>7. Live Tree Counter (Cloudflare Worker)</h2>
        <p>The <a href="/impact">Impact page</a> — and only that page — fetches a single number (the total count of trees planted so far) from a Cloudflare Worker we operate at <code>dontmailme-api.late-sound-79c8.workers.dev</code>. The request is read-only and anonymous: it carries no identifier, no cookie, and nothing about you or your mail. As with any HTTP request, Cloudflare processes technical connection data such as your IP address to deliver the response; we do not store it or build profiles from it. Legal basis: our legitimate interest (Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR) in showing an honest, live impact figure.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="info">
        <h2>8. Your Rights under the GDPR</h2>
        <p>You have the right to request information about your stored personal data (Art. 15 GDPR), request correction (Art. 16 GDPR), request deletion (Art. 17 GDPR), or restrict processing (Art. 18 GDPR). You also have the right to data portability (Art. 20 GDPR) and the right to object to processing (Art. 21 GDPR).</p>
        <p><strong>Right to complain:</strong> If you believe that the processing of your data violates data protection laws, you have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority (Art. 77 GDPR).</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
